<header class="page-header">
  <div class="container">
    <h1 class="page-title page-title-animated" data-split-text>FAQ</h1>
    <p class="page-desc" data-reveal>Common questions, clear answers</p>
  </div>
</header>

<section class="section faq-section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="faq-list">
      <div class="faq-item" data-reveal>
        <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false">
          <span>How long does shipping take?</span>
          <span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"/></svg>
          </span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p>Standard delivery takes 3–5 business days across Pakistan. Express delivery (1–2 days) is available at checkout for PKR 299. Free standard shipping on orders over PKR 3,499.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item" data-reveal>
        <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false">
          <span>What's your return policy?</span>
          <span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"/></svg>
          </span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p>We accept returns within 15 days of delivery. Items must be unworn, unwashed, and have all original tags attached. We offer free returns across Pakistan — just contact us and we'll arrange a pickup.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item" data-reveal>
        <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false">
          <span>How do I find my size?</span>
          <span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"/></svg>
          </span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p>Each product page has a size guide with measurements in inches and cm. Our baggy jeans are intentionally oversized — if you're between sizes, we recommend sizing down. For tees, the fit is intentionally relaxed so true-to-size works for most.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item" data-reveal>
        <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false">
          <span>What payment methods do you accept?</span>
          <span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"/></svg>
          </span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p>We accept Cash on Delivery (free) and credit/debit cards via secure 3D-Secure checkout. All online payments are processed through PCI-compliant gateways.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item" data-reveal>
        <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false">
          <span>Do you ship internationally?</span>
          <span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"/></svg>
          </span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p>Yes! We ship to UAE, Saudi Arabia, UK, US, and Canada. International orders ship via DHL Express (5–7 business days, USD 25 flat rate). Free shipping on international orders over USD 200.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item" data-reveal>
        <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false">
          <span>How do I track my order?</span>
          <span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"/></svg>
          </span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p>Once your order ships, you'll receive a tracking number via SMS and email. You can also track your order anytime on our <a href="/track">Track Order</a> page using your order ID.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="faq-item" data-reveal>
        <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false">
          <span>Are your products ethically made?</span>
          <span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"/></svg>
          </span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <p>Every BA GGY piece is stitched in our partner factories in Karachi and Lahore, where workers earn above-industry-standard wages in safe conditions. We visit each facility quarterly and publish a transparency report annually.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>


